			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741570301,
					"content": "此屋待售。价格实惠，欲购从速。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "房屋出售信息"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570302,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，还有派蒙姐姐，你们是来找勒鲁瓦先生的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570303,
						741570305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570303,
					"content": "伯努瓦在家吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741570304,
					"content": "不在这里，爸爸说勒鲁瓦先生不会再住在这里了，他住到地下去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570308,
					"content": "灰河？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741570309,
					"content": "是我们之前去过的那个灰河吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570310,
					"content": "那个的话，不是的，爸爸说的是更地下的地下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570311,
					"content": "蒸汽鸟报上说，勒鲁瓦先生爬山的时候从很高的地方摔下来，摔了一个大跟头。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570312,
					"content": "其实我不是很明白摔跟头和搬家之间有什么联系…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570313,
					"content": "对了，我刚刚来的时候见到女婿叔叔了，还有一个非常好心的大姐姐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570314,
					"content": "大姐姐很喜欢我，她的眼睛和我一样，都是紫色的呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570315,
					"content": "她还问了我家住在哪里，说有空会去看望我，做我的好朋友。果然勒鲁瓦先生一家都是很好的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570316,
					"content": "唉，本来带了泡泡桔过来想送给勒鲁瓦先生的，现在他不在这里…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570317,
					"content": "#{M#哥哥姐姐}{F#姐姐们}，我送给你们吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570318,
					"content": "谢谢你，小茉莉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570319,
					"content": "不客气啦，爸爸妈妈说对待朋友要慷慨。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570320,
					"content": "今天我又做了一件好事，回去我就把它写到日记里去，开心！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570321,
					"content": "你目送快乐的茉莉走出这条街，勒鲁瓦一家的故事就此结束。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 741570305,
					"content": "只是正巧路过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741570306,
					"content": "#我刚才在想，要不要告诉{M#哥哥姐姐}{F#姐姐们}，勒鲁瓦先生搬家了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741570307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741570307,
					"content": "爸爸说勒鲁瓦先生不会再住在这里了，他住到地下去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
